        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BGH05, Stainless Steel Bighorn Curved Pull with Mitered Ends</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Modern Curved Bighorn Door Pull features mitered ends for a clean, contemporary look. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths in satin stainless, polished stainless, or matte black finishes. The Modern Curved Stainless Steel Handle can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, metal, and even glass. Choose from surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BGH05-specifications.gif?v=1704442282\" width=\"588\" height=\"247\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" alt=\"First Impressions BGH05 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-BGH05012</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-BGH05024</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-BGH05036</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 26\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Requires 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Curved Bighorn Door Pull | Modern Curved Stainless Steel Handle",
                "description": "The Modern Curved Bighorn Door Pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch length. Choose from satin, polished, or matte black finishes for this The Modern Curved Stainless Steel Handle.",
